abstract: >-
  Static browser lab that presents experiments from the author's open research
  repositories as cards (claim, conditions, difference vs baseline with
  uncertainty, verdict), including failed results. Synthetic data is labelled
  synthetic. No quantum error correction, quantum advantage, hardware or
  consciousness claims.
keywords: [reproducibility, negative-results, anomaly-detection, research-software, evidence]
